  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Publicly traded entities are subject to heightened regulatory scrutiny (SEC, PCAOB) and have a broader group of financial statement users. Per AU-C 320.A3, the auditor considers users'' needs, and public company stakeholders typically require greater precision, leading to lower materiality levels.
